        "thesis pp129-130 Table 4.6 and discussion"
      ],
      "finding": "Main elution fractions contain F 658\u00b118, Al 807\u00b130 and Na 22600\u00b1400 mg/L plus other ions. Initial water wash loses fluoride; reuse and precipitation optimization are proposed. Thesis added economics uses a hypothetical industrial scenario. No isolated high-purity commodity, pilot operation, cyanide destruction result or microbial mechanism follows.",
      "disposition": "retain laboratory abiotic mixed-stream boundaries"
